Package: @PACKAGE_NAME@
Version: @VERSION@
Section: hamradio
Priority: optional
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: SX1255 FM Repeater Maintainers <root@localhost>
Depends: libc6, libasound2, libgpiod2, python3, svxlink-server, systemd, dialog
Description: SX1255 direct-I/O repeater integration for SvxLink
 Installs the SX1255 repeater binary, SvxLink PTT bridge, systemd units,
 snd-aloop setup, and SvxLink configuration for the direct-I/O repeater.
